## Review checklist

- Confirm desktop and mobile layouts do not overlap, clip, or corrupt text.
- Confirm keyboard focus and reduced-motion behavior.
- Confirm light/dark themes only when the project supports them.
- Confirm labels, errors, and empty states match actual behavior.
- Capture screenshots when the task changes visible output.

## Maintenance

Update when a durable user flow, interaction, accessibility behavior, responsive rule, visual token, or frontend performance requirement changes. Keep temporary implementation notes in the active task.
